    "title": "Coffee Break: Venues",
    "text": "Coffee Break\nCoffee Break: Venues\nby\nSeptember 24, 2025\nMusic and venues go hand in hand. Both add to the scene of any given location and are part of the musical ecosystem. Sometimes, special venues even hold a tender place in the heart of musicians and are even mentioned in songs!\nIt could be a funny story that happened at a bar one day, a tale about a club, or maybe a verse that includes a stadium of some sort. Let’s celebrate all of the venues – from historic to obscure - by suggesting songs that name-check our favorite musical watering holes and stages.\nSo for today’s 9:30 Coffee Break, what songs that mention music venues or clubs would you like to hear?\nRespond with your song ideas in the comments below.\nHave an idea for a Coffee Break topic? Submit your idea for a future theme and browse past Coffee Breaks in our archive.\nSongs Played\nIDLES- The Beachland Ballroom\nNOFX- Seeing Double At the Triple Rock\nTalking Heads- Life During Wartime\nProfessor Longhair- Tiptina\nThe Clash- (White Man) in Hammersmith Palais\nChic- Le Freak\nRicky Nelson- Garden Party",
